/P 210 0 R
/E ( In an era where the digital landscape is constantly evolving, organizations face an ever-increasing threat from cyberattacks. The need for swift and effective incident response has become paramount to safeguard sensitive data, protect digital assets, and maintain the trust of stakeholders. In response to this growing challenge, we present a visionary project: the development of an AI-driven incident response platform that empowers cybersecurity teams with the tools to automate and enhance incident triage and response tasks. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
273 0 obj
